Rama leaves hermits and enters dreadful forest --- Monstrous Viradha appears bearing spear with beasts --- Viradha snatches Sita and claims brothers doomed --- Viradha declares himself man-eating rakshasa --- Sita trembles like plantain in wind --- Rama grieves Kaikeyi's wish now fulfilled --- Rama mourns Sita touched more than lost kingdom --- Lakshmana vows arrow will fell Viradha